eone from outside. \n✅ Board meeting: Independent investigation, find a new CEO, establish a new national security committee.\n\nDo you think the board should let him come back? Let us know in the comments.","timestamp":"2026-11-17T17:42:30.000Z","stats":{"likes":6,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":8,"first_seen":"2026-11-18T09:54:19+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df18PAmFL35","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Df18PAmFL35","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"No need to keep switching apps for checkout! Samsung Wallet integrates all payment methods, payment codes and invoice attachments can be switched on the same interface, and you can also request a ride code. Only Galaxy models supported by the official store, Wallet 6.8.67 and above, need to be checked for compatibility with transportation and transportation networks. Is the actual operation smooth? The article link is in the comments.","timestamp":"2026-11-17T12:34:00.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-18T09:54:19+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df18Y-5lIta","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Df18Y-5lIta","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-17T12:35:22.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-18T09:54:19+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df1xbyYCsKd","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Df1xbyYCsKd","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"應該是全景相機拍的","timestamp":"2026-11-17T11:00:08.000Z","stats":{"likes":30,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":4},"score":30,"first_seen":"2026-11-18T09:54:19+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df0qHKtk8NB","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Df0qHKtk8NB","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-17T00:36:24.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-18T04:40:30+08:00",